The csproj's own header INVARIANT mandates the fix: "regenerate it directly from the Microsoft.UI-
free sources on disk." Regenerated into a single canonical Project root (mirroring the precedent set
by prior widget prompts that repaired the same corruption, e.g. shared-surfaces/0225 Select,
