    PLUS the new widget-primitives/WidgetDetailCard.Model.cs link = 1300 items.
  * before: 2817 lines, 3 Project roots, MSB4025 (unloadable).
  * after : 1363 lines, 1 Project root, valid XML, builds clean.
Only the corrupt csproj was touched (PropertyGroup / package & project refs / Content preserved
verbatim); no surface source files were modified.

